  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of the foot of perpendicular drawn from the centre of the ellipse&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> on any tangent to it is&nbsp;",
