  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The centre of the given ellipse&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />The general equation of a tangent to the ellipse</p><p><math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mi>a</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mi>y</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mi>b</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>Given ellipse&nbsp;:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>A perpendicular line from the centre is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Eliminating <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>, &nbsp;from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>&#177;&#160;</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#177;</mo><mi>y&#160;</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>Squaring both sides,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
